TI  - Bronchoplastic procedure for an unusual indication--Wegener's granulomatosis.
PG  - 530-1
LID - 10.1510/icvts.2009.205591 [doi]
AB  - Wegener's granulomatosis (WG) is a systemic vasculitic condition that commonly 
      affects the lung and kidneys. With improvement in medical therapy, airway 
      complications are increasingly encountered and are difficult to manage. Here, we 
      present a case whereby a patient presenting with airway complication is 
      successfully treated with surgery.
