TI  - [The role of the ultrasonography in pulmonary diagnostics].
PG  - 155-9
AB  - This article presents a review of ultrasonographic methods and their usefulness 
      in pulmonary diagnostics. Because of its advantages ultrasonography offers a 
      quick, cheap, and safe diagnostics of variety of pulmonary diseases. The role of 
      ultrasound in diagnostics of lung neoplasms, pleural, diaphragma, pericardium and 
      vessels pathology was described. Some restrictions of this tool were mentioned. 
      The newest methods of endobronchial ultrasound were also discussed.
