TI  - Pure yolk-sac tumor of the lung.
PG  - 410-1
AB  - Primary germ cell tumors of the chest often localize in the anterior mediastinal 
      compartment. Such tumors originating from lungs and pleura are rare. Chest 
      tomography revealed a mass in the middle lobe of the right lung in a 25-year-old 
      man. A middle lobe medial segmentectomy was performed, and chemotherapy was 
      applied postoperatively.
