AB  - Broncholithiasis is the presence of intrabronchial calcification or ossification. 
      We report a case of broncholiths resulting from extrusion of calcified 
      mediastinal lymph node into a bronchus associated with esophagobronchial fistula 
      that became more symptomatic after bronchoscopic removal of the broncholiths.
