TI  - [Clinical assessment of various treatments for tracheal stenosis].
PG  - 23-8
AB  - The paper deals with the management of cicatricial stenoses of the trachea, which 
      is a topical problem of modern thoracic surgery. Surgical techniques and 
      endoscopic operations aimed at expanding and maintaining the lumen of the airways 
      have been employed. Original types of surgical operations and new endoscopic 
      tools are proposed.
