AB  - Voriconazole penetrated well into the pulmonary epithelial lining fluid (ELF) in 
      lung transplant patients receiving oral prophylaxis. The ELF concentrations 
      exceeded those of the plasma, with an average ELF-to-plasma ratio of 11 (+/-8). A 
      strong association between plasma and ELF concentrations (r(2) = 0.95) was noted.
