AB  - The experience of the laser and electrocoagulational recanalization conduction of 
      the respiratory ways stenosis portions in 118 patients with respiratory organs 
      tumors was summarized. There was established the probability of the 
      recanalization application for tumoral and cicatricial tracheobronchial stenosis. 
      The advantages of various bronchoplastic operations application after performance 
      of endoscopic recanalization of tracheobronchial tree were noted. After 
      performance of endoscopic recanalization of respiratory ways all the patients are 
      alive.
