TI  - Guided tactile probing: a modified blind orotracheal intubation technique for the 
      problem-oriented difficult airway.
PG  - 106-9
AB  - We present 'tactile probing', a guided approach to blind orotracheal intubation 
      to secure a problem-oriented anticipated difficult airway in a 55-year-old male 
      patient scheduled for elective surgical tracheostomy for a postradiotherapy 
      translaryngeal carcinoma. Standard techniques to gain the airway were 
      inapplicable in this case and awake flexible fiberoscopy-aided intubation had 
      already failed.
