TI  - Intramural bronchogenic cyst in the carina observed in a neonate and treated by 
      needle aspiration: a case report.
PG  - 317-8
AB  - We report the first case to be observed in a neonate of an intramural 
      bronchogenic cyst in the carina. Considering the age of the infant, it was 
      decided to administer curative treatment by needle aspiration. A rigid 
      bronchoscopy was used. The outcome was favorable.
