AB  - Lung cancer is the leading cause of cancer mortality worldwide. The therapy 
      including combinations and novel schedules of administration with chemotherapy, 
      X-ray therapy, endoscopic procedure--brachy and laser therapy, don't contribute 
      to prolong a human survival rates. Among these, new endobronchial diagnosis and 
      treatment methods, including fluorescence and photodynamic therapy are used. The 
      authors shown diagnostic and therapeutic usefulness of fluorescence 
      bronchofiberoscopy.
