AB  - Tension pneumothorax during one-lung ventilation can be a life threatening 
      emergency. Clinical diagnosis may be confusing in the operative setting. We 
      present a case in which fiberoptic bronchoscopy excluded tube malpositioning and 
      lead us to the diagnosis of a tension pneumothorax.
