TI  - Colonic metastases from primary squamous cell carcinoma of the lung.
PG  - 719-20
AB  - Lung cancer is the most common malignancy in the UK. Metastasis to the colon is 
      very rare and only infrequently symptomatic. Here we report a case of squamous 
      cell carcinoma of the lung which presented with symptoms from a colonic 
      metastasis.
