TI  - [Lobar emphysema due to bronchial atresia associated with a bronchogenic cyst].
PG  - 543-5
AB  - We report a case of bronchial atresia in the apical segment of right down lobule 
      associated to subcarinal bronchogenic cyst in an eighteen years old patient who 
      consults by long time bronchitis. The thorax X-ray shows an image suggested of 
      mucoid impaction. The respiratory function tests are not essential for the 
      diagnostic. The fiber bronchoscopy is normal and the diagnostic is established by 
      mean image technics (thoracic HR-TC and MR).
