TI  - Occult lung cancer treatment.
PG  - 751-62, vii
AB  - Occult lung carcinomas are rare and provide a particular challenge for treatment. 
      They are lesions not evident on routine chest roentgenogram and chest computed 
      tomography. Surgical resection remains the gold standard for the treatment of 
      occult lung primaries; however, for nonsurgical candidates, multiple promising 
      treatment strategies are on the horizon.
