TI  - Tracheobronchial amyloidosis: a report of two cases.
PG  - 115-8
AB  - We describe here two patients with tracheobronchial involvement by amyloidosis. 
      One of them had presented with discrete tracheobronchial mass lesions simulating 
      bronchogenic carcinoma. The other had intermittent streaky hemoptysis and was 
      found to have diffuse tracheobronchial involvement at bronchoscopy. Both patients 
      are doing well without any definitive therapy.
