TI  - Fractured tracheostomy tubes in the tracheobronchial tree of a child.
PG  - 45-8
AB  - Fractured tracheostomy tube presenting as foreign bodies in the tracheobronchial 
      tree is rare. Only four previous episodes in children have been reported in 
      literature and most of these in developing countries. We report an unusual case 
      of fractured tracheostomy tubes in the tracheobronchial tree of a child and 
      review the literature.
