TI  - Interventional radiological removal of a foreign body from a peripheral bronchus.
PG  - 182-5
AB  - We describe the extraction of an impacted tooth from a bronchiole of a 
      ventilated, critically ill patient. Following failed attempts using flexible and 
      rigid bronchoscopy a radiological approach was explored. The successful method 
      described below used guiding catheters, an extraction basket and an occlusion 
      balloon, deployed under fluoroscopic guidance.
