TI  - Endobronchial carcinoid in a child: depiction with three-dimensional volume 
      rendering.
PG  - 1008-11
AB  - Endobronchial carcinoid is an extremely rare neoplasm in children. We report a 
      case in which this entity was prospectively diagnosed by 3-D CT bronchography 
      with volume rendering techniques. The ability to prospectively implicate an 
      endobronchial neoplasm in a child may help to guide subsequent therapy and 
      management.
