TI  - Sarcoidosis preceding chronic myelomonocytic leukemia. Report of two cases.
PG  - 409-12
AB  - We report 2 patients who had sarcoidosis with skin involvement associated with 
      bilateral anterior uveitis. During the follow-up, they developed chronic 
      myelomonocytic leukemia. This association is of particular interest as 
      sarcoidosis and chronic myelomonocytic leukemia may be considered as disorders of 
      a common monocyte-macrophage cell lineage.
