TI  - [Diagnostic flexible bronchoscopy. Recommendations of the Endoscopy Working Group 
      of the French Society of Pulmonary Medicine].
PG  - 1363-92
AB  - These guidelines on flexible bronchoscopy depict important clues to be known and 
      taken into account while practicing flexible bronchoscopy, in adult, except in 
      emergency situations. This is a practical clarification. Safety conditions, 
      complications, anesthesia, infectious risks, cleaning and disinfection are 
      detailed from a review of the literature. Intensive care practice of bronchoscopy 
      requires more attention due to higher risks patients and is discussed 
      extensively. Standards and performances of the various sampling techniques 
      complete this work. Indications for bronchoscopy, therapeutic and paediatric 
      bronchoscopy are not covered in these guidelines.
