TI  - [The use of endoscopic techniques in the diagnostics of the lung cancer].
PG  - 5-6
AB  - In modern pulmonology there are new sufficient and noninvasive diagnostic method 
      for staging of lung cancer. Bronchoscopy as a diagnostic and therapeutic tool was 
      introduced to medicine at the end of XIX and early XX century. Recently a new 
      image technique such as endobronchial ultrasonography has been developed. This 
      method has an effect on the qualitative changes in bronchoscopic investigation.
