PG  - 16-21
AB  - The study based on history data, including age, educational level, social status, 
      smoking, occupational risk factors, and a history of allergy and comorbidity, and 
      on radiation diagnostic and fibroscopic findings could yield criteria for 
      predicting potential recurrent sarcoidosis at the early stages of diagnosis of 
      the pathological process.
