TI  - Modified neodymium-YAG laser in rigid bronchoscopy.
PG  - 776-7
AB  - The use of laser bronchoscopy in the treatment of tracheobronchial stenosis has 
      been reported in the past. It is generally safe and effective; however, the 
      complications of haemorrhage, airway perforation, or airway fire are relatively 
      frequent among less experienced surgeons. We illustrate a modified technique of 
      laser probe location to simplify the laser ablation procedure.
