TI  - [Endoscopic characteristics of chronic bronchitis treated with substitution of 
      surfactant].
PG  - 49-52
AB  - An analysis has been performed of endoscopic management of chronic bronchitis 
      with making use of substitution surfactant therapy with a home-produced drug 
      preparation of the exogenous surfactant sucrim. Positive results obtained in the 
      studies conducted permit the substantiation of a 2-fold use of the above drug in 
      a combined treatment. Visual normalization of bronchial mucosa in purulent 
      diffuse endobronchitis, degree III intensity of inflammation, was seen by day 8 
      to 12 from the commencement of therapy.
