TI  - Documentation in bronchology.
PG  - 373-9, ix-x
AB  - With the performance of more endoscopic procedures and newly developed diagnostic 
      and therapeutic modalities, a wealth of information around the actual procedure 
      is created. To date, accepted guidelines for standardized documentation are 
      lacking. The authors present recommendations for minimal guidelines that may help 
      to facilitate good documentation and also address future developments that will 
      be possible with the help of computer-assisted approaches.
