DP  - 2006 Jan-Apr
TI  - [Pulmonary alveolar proteinosis and crazy paving pattern in high resolution CT].
PG  - 127-30
AB  - We present a case of pulmonary alveolar proteinosis in a 27 year old male, in 
      which high resolution computerised tomography shows a typical crazy paving 
      pattern. This test led to a specific differential diagnosis, in spite of the lack 
      of specificity in the clinical presentation. The bronchoalveolar wash was not 
      conclusive and the definitive diagnosis was made with a transbronchial biopsy. We 
      review the most characteristic aspects of this rare disease and of the crazy 
      paving pattern in high resolution CT.
