TI  - Tracheobronchopathia osteochondroplastica in a patient with silicosis: CT, 
      bronchoscopy, and pathology findings.
PG  - 801-3
AB  - A case of tracheobronchopathia osteochondroplastica in a patient with silicosis 
      is reported, showing a rare association of disease. Etiological hypotheses and 
      clinical aspects are discussed. Radiologic, bronchoscopic, and pathologic 
      findings are demonstrated with emphasis on the role of computed tomography (CT) 
      in the diagnosis of this disease.
