TI  - Bronchial entrapment of a chicken bone for 14 years.
PG  - 914-5
AB  - Prolonged airway entrapment of a foreign body is a rare occurrence. We report a 
      case of a chicken bone retained in the right main bronchus for 14 years and 
      highlight the importance of a foreign body in the airway in the differential 
      diagnosis of chronic and intractable cough.
