AB  - OBJECTIVE: To evaluate the clinical application of CT virtual bronchoscope in 
      foreign-body in bonchus. METHOD: The CT virtual bronchoscope were used in 21 
      cases with foreign-body in bronchus, all the images and reports were compared 
      with the actual bronchoscopy. RESULT: The reports and images of CT virtual 
      bronchoscope are very agreed with that of actual bronchoscopy. CONCLUSION: CT 
      virtual bronchoscope is a very good complemental method in preoperative diagnosis 
      of foreign-body in bronchus.
