AB  - 67 patients with inhalation trauma of 90 patients with acute thermal trauma and 
      23 healthy controls participated in the trial. External respiration function was 
      assessed on the spirograph SPIROSIFT-3000 (Fukuda Densy, Japan). The injured 
      patients have undergone chest vibromassage (n = 23), vibromassage of 
      Zakhariin-Head zones (trachea-bronchi-lungs) (n = 22), manual chest massage (n = 
      22). Improvement of clinical and external respiration parameters was more 
      significant in patients exposed to vibromassage of the trachea-bronchi-lungs 
      zones.
